[{:db/id "q-42159/selection/b02dee3bb4ab371c025bd46d6100712757efd28ff713a844f93fbe09e69751e9" :answer/id #uuid "7269258f-fec5-5bbb-b9ac-ac391cf2d803" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4-7y \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42159/selection/6d6811ceb4fb69a54ce1b24e6804e5f0148bafa1b76b847b06436eb966d36b67" :answer/id #uuid "4fd482d8-f60a-5148-9f6e-b79c7d979f48" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No solution" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42159/selection/229e1ebb650f7a7b5409aa4f52da7032d59a6ec63af7c93ad4dfa9c4892b2d8b" :answer/id #uuid "a9c8fc27-eea6-58b7-8ee7-83ef5adb59d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}6-9y \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42159/selection/c6c085f2182285c9f59de0ac0095d986ffdaf9963ef6ce33b10225ad0c1be1e4" :answer/id #uuid "a94b1d4d-b777-524f-896a-1e1d01d4f041" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4+7y \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42159/selection/3e3c260dd4bace5866a586405ed51557540dfb2da692b593e78eb35d0e4a4244" :answer/id #uuid "bb7372e7-57d6-59b3-81ca-1c4c1ef7765f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}7-4y \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42159/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3ac7c8b0-da3c-5be0-8825-21b269cb0d26" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-42159/selection/b02dee3bb4ab371c025bd46d6100712757efd28ff713a844f93fbe09e69751e9" :answer-field/choices ["q-42159/selection/b02dee3bb4ab371c025bd46d6100712757efd28ff713a844f93fbe09e69751e9" "q-42159/selection/6d6811ceb4fb69a54ce1b24e6804e5f0148bafa1b76b847b06436eb966d36b67" "q-42159/selection/229e1ebb650f7a7b5409aa4f52da7032d59a6ec63af7c93ad4dfa9c4892b2d8b" "q-42159/selection/c6c085f2182285c9f59de0ac0095d986ffdaf9963ef6ce33b10225ad0c1be1e4" "q-42159/selection/3e3c260dd4bace5866a586405ed51557540dfb2da692b593e78eb35d0e4a4244"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-42159" :question/id #uuid "9c7ee632-816a-5fbf-851b-1067bcb868c7" :question/math-academy-id "q-42159" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+7y=4 \\\\ 6x+42y=24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system." :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 42 & -24\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 42 & 24\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-6){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+7y=4 \\\\ 0x+0y=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx+7y=4.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=4-7y,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=4-7y \\\\ y=y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number. \n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4-7y \\\\ y\\end{aligned}],\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-42159/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07f2ae4c-ff07-5b99-a7b0-90f460081eef"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42159"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73524/selection/d213a4f2864a4fae5b8a01899cbff26f48c0f2471f2f1e71c84b1dde1c28e923" :answer/id #uuid "e7dd921c-c2b3-51ad-96d2-8fb7b6ca2d76" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}4 & -16 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73524/selection/590c099d3c4d3bf9cb2d45f646b492b96947b9e07abf3b1ea64106199b743f30" :answer/id #uuid "ac692bba-6fd6-5bf8-b1f7-8b14128534ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73524/selection/4dd8f27fe381eb7d58a66563cfddf217ee2986372968c4ebcb0d00c8544b6df6" :answer/id #uuid "00c62328-5754-51fd-8088-863de126a815" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 12\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73524/selection/c0c18af1be7cb0f54f30d461e7e42e393837582f33ba62eba68e6ad9e4fef0c9" :answer/id #uuid "81e9e09d-ea20-5659-9ceb-89b5fa9643dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -16 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73524/selection/48b23720527fb633a839a83074ccbb68583cda3f946f1686c36cefac7e8a90e8" :answer/id #uuid "578a233f-dee0-550f-a731-62495df83069" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73524/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a55b426d-006f-533e-803e-ff82ad34ad9a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73524/selection/590c099d3c4d3bf9cb2d45f646b492b96947b9e07abf3b1ea64106199b743f30"